+/* Idle aura: a soft outer glow behind the seal that breathes very slowly
+   (9s) — NOT the old noir-spin-breathe pulse (that moved the ring itself
+   every frame and was dropped for reading as too heavy/nagging; see the
+   note above). This sits behind the button as its own layer, never
+   changes the ring/shadow above, and is subtle enough that a player who
+   isn't looking for it won't consciously notice it, while the button
+   still doesn't read as inert. Disabled/busy states get no aura — juice
+   belongs on the action that's actually available. */
+.respin-btn::before {
+  content: "";
+  position: absolute;
+  inset: -10px;
+  border-radius: 50%;
